# ==============================================================================
# CivicFix Root Environment Configuration Reference (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# CivicFix uses separate environment configurations for server and client workspaces.
#
# Backend Configuration:
# Copy `server/.env.example` to `server/.env` and configure:
#   - PORT=5000
#   - MONGODB_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/civicfix
#   - SESSION_SECRET=<32+ character random secret>
#   - CLIENT_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
#
# Frontend Configuration:
# Copy `client/.env.example` to `client/.env` and configure:
#   - VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api/v1
#
# Note: Root .gitignore excludes all `.env` files while preserving `.env.example`.

